{
    "title": "Pixyworld - Watch Face",
    "description": "PixyWorld - Watch Face: The World Got Better\r\n\r\nTransform your smartwatch experience with PixyWorld, a beautifully designed and feature-packed watch face for Wear OS. With dynamic moon phases, real-time health tracking, and stylish customization options, it\u2019s the perfect addition to your wrist.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nNew Styles: Customize your watch face with a variety of styles and layouts to suit your preferences.\r\n\r\nMoon Phases: Stay in tune with the lunar cycle by displaying the current phase of the moon on your watch face. Whether you're an astronomy enthusiast or simply appreciate the beauty of the night sky, this feature adds a touch of elegance to your smartwatch.\r\n\r\nStep Count: Keep track of your daily physical activity effortlessly. The WatchFace app utilizes the built-in sensors on your smartwatch to accurately count your steps throughout the day.\r\n\r\nHeart Rate Monitor: Monitor your heart rate on the go. Whether you're engaged in a workout or simply curious about your ongoing heart health, the WatchFace app provides real-time heart rate readings. Stay informed, motivated, and make healthier choices by tracking your heart rate throughout the day.\r\n\r\nRegular Updates: We are committed to continuously improving the WatchFace app and adding new features based on user feedback. Expect regular updates that enhance functionality and introduce exciting new options to further enhance your smartwatch experience.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a fitness enthusiast, an astronomy lover, the Pixyworld WatchFace on your WearOS Smartwatch is the perfect addition to your smartwatch. Stay informed, motivated, and stylish with this comprehensive and feature-packed application.\r\n\r\nSupported Smartwatch / Installation\r\nInstall the watch face on your smartwatch through our companion app (only for Wear OS by Google).\r\nCompatibility: This watch face is compatible only with Wear OS 3.0 (Android 11) or higher.\r\n\r\nImportant: Ensure your smartwatch meets the specified requirements before installing this app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "PixyWorld - Watch Face: The World Got Better<br><br>Transform your smartwatch experience with PixyWorld, a beautifully designed and feature-packed watch face for Wear OS. With dynamic moon phases, real-time health tracking, and stylish customization options, it\u2019s the perfect addition to your wrist.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>New Styles: Customize your watch face with a variety of styles and layouts to suit your preferences.<br><br>Moon Phases: Stay in tune with the lunar cycle by displaying the current phase of the moon on your watch face. Whether you&#39;re an astronomy enthusiast or simply appreciate the beauty of the night sky, this feature adds a touch of elegance to your smartwatch.<br><br>Step Count: Keep track of your daily physical activity effortlessly. The WatchFace app utilizes the built-in sensors on your smartwatch to accurately count your steps throughout the day.<br><br>Heart Rate Monitor: Monitor your heart rate on the go. Whether you&#39;re engaged in a workout or simply curious about your ongoing heart health, the WatchFace app provides real-time heart rate readings. Stay informed, motivated, and make healthier choices by tracking your heart rate throughout the day.<br><br>Regular Updates: We are committed to continuously improving the WatchFace app and adding new features based on user feedback. Expect regular updates that enhance functionality and introduce exciting new options to further enhance your smartwatch experience.<br><br>Whether you&#39;re a fitness enthusiast, an astronomy lover, the Pixyworld WatchFace on your WearOS Smartwatch is the perfect addition to your smartwatch. Stay informed, motivated, and stylish with this comprehensive and feature-packed application.<br><br>Supported Smartwatch / Installation<br>Install the watch face on your smartwatch through our companion app (only for Wear OS by Google).<br>Compatibility: This watch face is compatible only with Wear OS 3.0 (Android 11) or higher.<br><br>I